  "description": "Conversion of Semi-Detached dwelling into Two Separate Dwellings (1x2 bed and 1x3 bed); provision of cycle parking and bin storage, subdivision of amenity space including new front porch to No. 20A and creation of a crossover",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reason of the insertion of a secondary front porch, and the poor outlook from Bedroom 2 of Unit No. 20, would result in a poor residential layout, substandard level of internal amenity for future occupiers and would harm the charcater and amenity of the host dwellinghouse and wider streetscape.&amp;nbsp;The proposal is therefore contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies D3 and D6 of the London Plan (2021), Harrow Core Strategy Policy CS1 (2012), Policies DM1, DM26 and DM27 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013), and the London Borough of Harrow’s Residential Design Guide Supplementary Planning Document (2010).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
